; Caulder, D3 "Claw, stomp": the sketch D hook and gallop at 108 bpm with a half-time stomp: kick on one, snare on three, toms and a heavier timpani. B minor. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_d3
tempo 108
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst horn = A.111 shift=-12
inst pick = A.36 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
inst timp = A.47 shift=24
hit kick=36 rim=37 clap=39 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

